  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Access to Support Services for Vulnerable Migrants in the North Pacific</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to comprehensive protection of vulnerable migrants and promote safe migration amongst persons at-risk across the North Pacific region. IOM, in partnership with the respective governments, will support comprehensive protection services by enhancing the capacity of service providers, strengthening national and regional coordination, improving access to support services and raising public awareness on migration-related risks across the region.</narrative>
  </description>
